    "long_instructions": "#AI in Content Creation\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**: How do I use AI to grow my channel without losing my original voice?\r\n\r\n####Color-Coding Key\r\n\r\n**Green** - Sections of text that AI generated that you would keep as-is.\r\n\r\n**Blue** - Sections of text that you have edited and revised.\r\n\r\n**Red** - Sections of text that AI generated that you reject.\r\n",
