            "locked": true,
            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 3,
            "text": "Analyze AI's suggestions:\n \n* Decide which sections that AI wrote that you \n  would keep as-is. Color code these green by \n  dragging green boxes onto the text\n\n* Find places that you would edit or revise. \n  Make those changes. Color code these blue.\n\n* Color-code the text red for ideas that you \n  reject as too fake or not-interesting.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "Analyze AI's suggestions:\n \n* Decide which sections that AI wrote that you \n  would keep as-is. Color code these green by \n  dragging green boxes onto the text\n\n* Find places that you would edit or revise. \n  Make those changes. Color code these blue.\n\n* Color-code the text red for ideas that you \n  reject as too fake or not-interesting.",
